# End-to-end walkthrough. Works in Visual Studio, Rider, and VS Code (REST Client).
# Start the stack first: docker compose up -d --build   (or run the API locally on the same port)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@api = {{baseUrl}}/api/v1
@email = demo@example.com
@password = Password123

### Health (database readiness only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### 1. Register — creates a tenant and a user, audits it, and queues a welcome email (see Mailpit: http://localhost:8025)
# @name register
POST {{api}}/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}", "firstName": "Demo", "lastName": "User", "password": "{{password}}" }

### 2. Login
# @name login
POST {{api}}/users/login
Content-Type: application/json
Correlation-Id: demo-login-1

{ "email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}" }

@accessToken = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
@refreshToken = {{login.response.body.refreshToken}}

### 3. Current user (tenant-scoped)
GET {{api}}/users/{{register.response.body.$}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 4. Create a todo
# @name createTodo
POST {{api}}/todos
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "description": "Try the template", "labels": ["demo"], "priority": 2 }

### 5. List my todos
GET {{api}}/todos
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 6. Complete it
PUT {{api}}/todos/{{createTodo.response.body.$}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 7. Error shape: unknown todo → 404 with code + correlationId
GET {{api}}/todos/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Correlation-Id: demo-not-found

### 8. Rotate the refresh token
# @name refresh
POST {{api}}/users/refresh-token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}" }

### 9. Replay the old refresh token → 400, and the whole session family is revoked (Critical audit entry)
POST {{api}}/users/refresh-token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}" }

### 10. Logout (revokes a session you own)
POST {{api}}/users/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{refresh.response.body.refreshToken}}" }
